error[E0107]: [CGP-E034] `CanCalculateArea` is a consumer trait and cannot bound an inner provider; a higher-order provider imports its provider trait `AreaCalculator`
  --> src/main.rs:25:23
   |
25 | #[use_provider(Inner: CanCalculateArea<Shape>)]
   |                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: name the provider trait in the bound, idiomatically `#[use_provider(… : AreaCalculator<Shape>)]` (not the consumer trait `CanCalculateArea`)

